    "Email-留学东师\n中文\n|\nEnglish\nHome\nAbout NENU\nAbout NENU\nSchools & Departments\nAbout Changchun\nContact Us\nAdmission\nBachelor's Program\nMaster's Program\nDoctoral Program\nLanguage Learning Program\nPre-University Program\nExchange Student Program\nHighlighted Program\nEnglish-taught Program\nShort-term Program\nScholarship\nChinese Government Scholarship\nInternational Chinese Language Teachers Scholarship\nMofcom Scholarship\nPresidential Scholarship for Outstanding International Students\nNENU Scholarships for Outstanding Self-Financed International Students\nFaculty Profiles\nFaculty of Education\nSchool of Psychology\nSchool of Politics and Law\nBusiness School\nSchool of Literature\nSchool of History and Culture\nSchool of International Studies\nSchool of Music and Dance\nSchool of Fine Arts\nFaculty of Marxism\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics\nSchool of Information Science and Technology\nSchool of Physics\nSchool of Chemistry\nSchool of Life Sciences\nSchool of Geographical Sciences\nSchool of Environment\nSchool of Physical Education\nSchool of Media Science\nSchool of International Chinese Education\nCenter for Ideological and Political Education\nCampus Life\nRegulations\nAccommodation\nInsurance\nVisa\nEmail\nStudent Identity Account\nCampus Map\nStudent Activity\nUpcoming Activities\nActivity Recap\nVideo\nNENU Promotion\nStudent Activities\nVlog\nDownload\nCampus Life\nEmail\nHome\n>>\nCampus Life\nRegulations\nAccommodation\nInsurance\nVisa\nEmail\nStudent Identity Account\nCampus Map\nHow to apply for NENU email for individuals\nStep 1:\nFind the E-hall service from the website https://www.nenu.edu.cn/index.htm. If you are outside of the campus, please log in to WebVPN first with your student ID number and password. For the first time of login, the password is 10 digitals which are “Nenu+last six number of your passport”, e.g.: Nenu123456. If you have trouble, please go to Room 315 of Vision Building for help. Hotline: 8509-9005.\nStep 2:\nLog in with your student ID number and password. For the first time of login, the password is 10 digitals which are “Nenu+last six number of your passport”, e.g.: Nenu123456. If you have trouble, please go to Room 315 of Vision Building for help. Hotline: 8509-9005.\nStep 3:\nIf you are not able to choose the language, please input “邮箱”（email）to find the service of “个人邮箱申请”（NENU email application for individuals）. Or go to the G section to find the service of “个人邮箱申请”（NENU email application for individuals）.\nStep 4:\nStarting the application by clicking the orange button “开始办理”(start application).\nStep 5:\nConfirm your Chinese Name, Student ID, and School information, input your cellphone number, and choose your email address, if you want to add three numbers to your email address you could choose yes and input three numbers between 100 to 999. After you are done, click the green button on the right to submit your application.\nStep 6:\nEnd of application. Login to E-hall to check your email address and change the password.\nNote：\nIf you forget your password or your account is locked, please visit Room 315 of Vision Building or send an email to xxhb@nenu.edu.cn to reset your password.\nFollow Us：\nStudyatNENU Wechat\nScan for Inquiries\nCopyright： International Students Office, Division of  International Cooperation & Exchange\nAdd：Room 624, Administration Building, Northeast Normal University, No. 5268, Renmin Street, Changchun, Jilin, P.R.China\nTel：0431-85099754/85685722\nEmail：iso@nenu.edu.cn, admission@nenu.edu.cn\nWeb：http://iso.nenu.edu.cn\nRegistration Web：http://studyatnenu.nenu.edu.cn\nUseful Links：\nNENU Homepage\nChina Scholarship Council\nCenter for Language Education and Cooperation\nHSK Test Service"
